      "details": "<p>\u00a0The discovery of a stele of the Assyrian king Sargon II (r. 721-705 BC) at Najafabad might indicate that the ancient name of the place, at least in the eighth century BC, might have been Ki\u0161esim. This is by no means certain.</p>",
